		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Loathsome spirit of those gruesomely slain in nature. Blue apparition, backwards- facing feet. Possesses wild animals to wreak havoc on mortal victims.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +7 (2d8 + bleed), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Possess</strong>. One animal in sight, contested CHA check. If bhuta wins, it inhabits animal's body and controls it for 2d6 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
